  "passes": 1,
  "note": "Kalverstraat 210-204 (even side, south end): four 18th-c. gable houses over shop storeys (Rijksmonumenten 2183-2186): a white-plastered neck gable (210), two brick neck/bell gables with carved claw pieces (208, 206) and a black-painted neck gable (204). Wide cross windows fill the upper storeys of 208-204."
 },
